{"pageProps":{"data":{"news_id":"808","news_catgory":"0","hot_news":"0","news_push":"","news_on_top":"1","news_title":"南部電廠升級 減碳量等同逾千座大安森林公園效益","news_summary":"","image_path":"","news_content":"<p initial=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 30px; display: block; margin-block-start: 0.1em; margin-block-end: 0.1em; margin-inline-start: 0px; margin-inline-end: 0px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: 微軟正黑體, \\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 16px;\\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: 微軟正黑體, sans-serif;\\\">最新更新：<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">2020/03/03 16:24</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p initial=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 30px; display: block; margin-block-start: 0.1em; margin-block-end: 0.1em; margin-inline-start: 0px; margin-inline-end: 0px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: 微軟正黑體, \\\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p initial=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 30px; display: block; margin-block-start: 0.1em; margin-block-end: 0.1em; margin-inline-start: 0px; margin-inline-end: 0px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: 微軟正黑體, \\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 16px;\\\"><span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: 微軟正黑體, sans-serif;\\\"><img alt=\\\"\\\" src=\\\"http://www.stspcsr.com.tw/user_files/news_files/%E5%8D%97%E9%83%A8%E9%9B%BB%E5%BB%A0.jpg\\\" style=\\\"border: 0px; border-image: none; width: 80%; vertical-align: middle; box-sizing: border-box;\\\" />&nbsp;</span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p initial=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 30px; display: block; margin-block-start: 0.1em; margin-block-end: 0.1em; margin-inline-start: 0px; margin-inline-end: 0px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: 微軟正黑體, \\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 16px;\\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: 微軟正黑體, sans-serif;\\\">台電<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">3</span>日表示，南部電廠環保升級計畫自<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">2015</span>年起啟動，氮氧化物排放年減超過<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">6</span>成，二氧化碳減排近<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">40</span>萬噸，等同逾千座大安森林公園的吸碳量效益。（圖取自台電網頁<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">taipower.com.tw/TC</span>）</span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p initial=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 30px; display: block; margin-block-start: 0.1em; margin-block-end: 0.1em; margin-inline-start: 0px; margin-inline-end: 0px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: 微軟正黑體, \\\"><span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 14pt; font-family: 微軟正黑體, sans-serif;\\\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n\r\n<hr initial=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: content-box; height: 1px; margin-top: 20px; margin-bottom: 20px; border: 0px; background-image: -webkit-linear-gradient(left, transparent, rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.2), transparent); color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: 微軟正黑體, \\\" />\r\n<p initial=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 30px; display: block; margin-block-start: 0.1em; margin-block-end: 0.1em; margin-inline-start: 0px; margin-inline-end: 0px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: 微軟正黑體, \\\"><span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 14pt; font-family: 微軟正黑體, sans-serif;\\\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p 255=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"margin: 0px 0px 30px; text-align: justify; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); text-transform: none; text-indent: 0px; letter-spacing: normal; font-family: 微軟正黑體,\\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 14pt; font-family: 微軟正黑體, sans-serif;\\\">（中央社記者蔡芃敏台北<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">3</span>日電）台電表示，自<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">2015</span>年起啟動的南部電廠環保升級計畫，包括電廠<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">4</span>部機組、共<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">7</span>台氣渦輪機已完成環保設備更新，氮氧化物排放年減超過<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">6</span>成，二氧化碳減排近<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">40</span>萬噸，等同逾千座大安森林公園的吸碳量效益。</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p 255=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"margin: 0px 0px 30px; text-align: justify; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); text-transform: none; text-indent: 0px; letter-spacing: normal; font-family: 微軟正黑體,\\\"><span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 14pt; font-family: 微軟正黑體, sans-serif;\\\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p 255=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"margin: 0px 0px 30px; text-align: justify; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); text-transform: none; text-indent: 0px; letter-spacing: normal; font-family: 微軟正黑體,\\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 14pt; font-family: 微軟正黑體, sans-serif;\\\">台電今天發布新聞稿指出，為了兼顧供電與環保，台電在<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">2015</span>年啟動南部電廠環保升級計畫，<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">4</span>部機組、共<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">7</span>台氣渦輪機，陸續完成機組熱元件升級更新。</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p 255=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"margin: 0px 0px 30px; text-align: justify; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); text-transform: none; text-indent: 0px; letter-spacing: normal; font-family: 微軟正黑體,\\\"><span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 14pt; font-family: 微軟正黑體, sans-serif;\\\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p 255=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"margin: 0px 0px 30px; text-align: justify; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); text-transform: none; text-indent: 0px; letter-spacing: normal; font-family: 微軟正黑體,\\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 14pt; font-family: 微軟正黑體, sans-serif;\\\">設備升級後，氮氧化物（<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">NOx</span>）排放年減超過<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">60%</span>，將近<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">1400</span>噸。二氧化碳排放年減近<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">40</span>萬噸，等同超過<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">1000</span>座大安森林公園的吸碳量。</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p 255=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"margin: 0px 0px 30px; text-align: justify; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); text-transform: none; text-indent: 0px; letter-spacing: normal; font-family: 微軟正黑體,\\\"><span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 14pt; font-family: 微軟正黑體, sans-serif;\\\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p 255=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"margin: 0px 0px 30px; text-align: justify; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); text-transform: none; text-indent: 0px; letter-spacing: normal; font-family: 微軟正黑體,\\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 14pt; font-family: 微軟正黑體, sans-serif;\\\">台電解釋，複循環機組分為前段氣渦輪機發電及後段熱回收鍋爐發電，透過燃燒天然氣，讓高溫、高壓的熱燃氣推動氣渦輪機葉片，再帶動發電機轉換成為電力。南部電廠更新承受熱燃氣相關元件，包含低氮氧化物燃燒器、氣渦輪機葉片等，提升燃燒效率後，即可降低排放，更可延長機組大修週期，全場每小時發電能力還能增加<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">8.47</span>萬瓩。</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p 255=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"margin: 0px 0px 30px; text-align: justify; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); text-transform: none; text-indent: 0px; letter-spacing: normal; font-family: 微軟正黑體,\\\"><span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 14pt; font-family: 微軟正黑體, sans-serif;\\\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p 255=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"margin: 0px 0px 30px; text-align: justify; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); text-transform: none; text-indent: 0px; letter-spacing: normal; font-family: 微軟正黑體,\\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 14pt; font-family: 微軟正黑體, sans-serif;\\\">南部電廠歷史悠久、成立於<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">1955</span>年，是國民政府來台後首座興建火力電廠，也是台電唯一在都市的電廠。南部電廠當時肩負南部穩定供電責任，走過重工業發展、設立全世界首個加工出口區及高科技園區轉型。</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p 255=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"margin: 0px 0px 30px; text-align: justify; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); text-transform: none; text-indent: 0px; letter-spacing: normal; font-family: 微軟正黑體,\\\"><span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 14pt; font-family: 微軟正黑體, sans-serif;\\\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p 255=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"margin: 0px 0px 30px; text-align: justify; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); text-transform: none; text-indent: 0px; letter-spacing: normal; font-family: 微軟正黑體,\\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 14pt; font-family: 微軟正黑體, sans-serif;\\\">台電說，原本興建<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">3</span>部燃煤機組與<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">3</span>部氣渦輪機組，不過，南部電廠自<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">1990</span>年代起，陸續更新為<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">4</span>部燃氣複循環發電機組，目前總裝置容量達<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">111.78</span>萬瓩，年發電量約<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">80</span>億度，等同高雄地區用電每<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">4</span>度就有<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">1</span>度來自這座電廠。（編輯：郭無患）<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">1090303</span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p initial=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 30px; display: block; margin-block-start: 0.1em; margin-block-end: 0.1em; margin-inline-start: 0px; margin-inline-end: 0px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: 微軟正黑體, \\\"><span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 14pt; font-family: 微軟正黑體, sans-serif;\\\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p initial=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 30px; display: block; margin-block-start: 0.1em; margin-block-end: 0.1em; margin-inline-start: 0px; margin-inline-end: 0px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: 微軟正黑體, \\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 16px;\\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: 微軟正黑體, sans-serif;\\\">資料來源<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">: https://www.cna.com.tw/news/firstnews/202003030180.aspx</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p initial=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 30px; display: block; margin-block-start: 0.1em; margin-block-end: 0.1em; margin-inline-start: 0px; margin-inline-end: 0px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: 微軟正黑體, \\\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n","keyword":"","news_order_id":"0","create_date":"2020-03-04","clk_count":"236"}},"__N_SSG":true}